error[SC0409]: this reads `p`, which another operand of the same expression writes
   ╭─[ a_conflict_between_operands_inside_a_length_is_told_to_write_in_the_body.c:3:23 ]
   │
 3 │ int f(int *p, int a[g(p, 1) + (p = 0, 1)]) {
   │                       ┬        ──┬──  
   │                       ╰─────────────── read here
